# No Backward Compatibility

This project is pre-alpha. **Backward compatibility is not a valid concern.**

- Do not keep old URLs, APIs, schemas, on-chain layouts, or behaviors "for compatibility"
- Do not add shims, dual-write, deprecation windows, or migration layers unless the user explicitly asks
- Prefer deleting/replacing the old path over supporting both
- Do not mention or plan around "breaking existing users/clients" as a reason to keep dead code
